   "text": "Nine hours in, you're eye to eye with the top of the Eiffel Tower. By the second day, your head is up in the clouds. About ten days in, you pass the top of Mount Everest, and the air around your face is too thin to breathe. Two weeks in, airliners cruise past your chin.",
